# Version-controlled exceptions for the ML-service image vulnerability gate.
# Entries are reviewed through pull requests and validated before each CI run.
# The validator requires: advisory ID, owner:, exp:YYYY-MM-DD, and reason:.
# The shared expiry filter then writes only active IDs to a runtime-only file.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNN  # owner:team-or-person exp:YYYY-MM-DD reason:time-bounded rationale
#
# No active exceptions.
